/-! ### The class `𝒪` of strongly `H¹`-measurable fields -/

open ClassOH1 (H1R fn grd L2R L2V hasWeakGradient_congr_ae)
open OccupationPhysicalClass (volI sqPair Tlin T Jlin J IsOccField)
